 4. 🛢️ Charted: Heating oil sticker shock 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Data: FactSet, Axios research. Chart: Axios 📈 Oil hit $100 a barrel this morning as the war with Iran inflames tensions across the Middle East. Go deeper .

 Home heating oil bills are likely to be massive this winter in the Northeast, Axios' Matt Phillips writes. 

 Benchmark U.S. home heating oil futures have leapfrogged highs hit in late 2022. U.S. heating oil futures are up just shy of 30% over the last three months. And they're up about 120% since the start of the year. Get Axios Markets . 

 
 
